  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "O-okay."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ\u3000ソノ野菜モ\u3000健康ノタメニ\u3000必要ナノヨ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje, Those Vegetables Are Good For Your Health Too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェーロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hielo"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、分かってる……わよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I know... that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。全部食べたら、一緒にいい場所へ行きましょう。\n素敵なお店を見つけたのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Once you finish everything, let's go somewhere nice together. I found a wonderful shop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お店……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A shop...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。アンチュは気に入ると思うの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I think you'll love it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、ええと……私、これから素材を探しに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "U-um... I need to go look for materials..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "素材？\u3000どこまで行くの？\u3000私も一緒に行こうかしら。\nアンチュにぴったりとくっついてね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Materials? Where are you going? Perhaps I'll come along. I could stay right by your side."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、えっと、その……クリセルダには内緒……っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "U-um, well... it's a secret from you, Criselda...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私……何か悪いことをしたかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did I... do something wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あらあら、呆然としてしまって）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Oh my, she's completely stunned.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アンチュの初めての反抗ですから、\n\u3000無理もありませんわね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is Antje's first act of defiance, so it's understandable.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それにしても、あの子は何を……？\n\u3000後で、様子を見に行ってみましょうか）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Still, I wonder what she's up to... Perhaps I should check on her later.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "テス・ハイツマン。相変わらずかわいいわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess Heitzmann. You're as adorable as ever."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、リゼ……じゃなかった、クリセルダ！\n元気だった～？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Cris... I mean, Criselda! How've you been?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "テス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、この通りよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, doing well, as you can see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ、折り入って頼みがあるの。あなたにとっても\nいい話だと思うのだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Say, I have a favor to ask. I think it could work out well for you too..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へぇ、それは面白そう！\u3000それならさ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, sounds interesting! In that case..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "テス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、それは素敵ね。では早速……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, wonderful. Then let's get started right away..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、今度は何を企んでいるのかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, what is she plotting now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兎耳の髪飾りが特徴的な、陽気で賑やかな女性。\n星誕祭の出来事をきっかけにクリセルダと親しくなった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A cheerful, lively woman distinguished by her bunny ear accessories. She grew close to Criselda following the events of the Star Festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "テス・ハイツマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess Heitzmann"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]